// `#define break 0` is "a plain number": `break;` becomes `0;`. The checker narrows q after `if (!q) { break; }`, and C runs on into q*. UBSan: load of null pointer.
#define break 0
main: proc() -> i32 = { q: option<*i32 in permanent> = {}; while (1 == 1) { if (!q) { break; } return q*; } return 0; }
